Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur5\move(540,1030,540,995)\fad(500,400)}Birds don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur5\move(540,1030,540,995)\fad(500,400)}I feed what stays.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:11.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur5\move(540,1030,540,995)\fad(500,400)}Fish rise for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:14.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur5\move(540,1030,540,995)\fad(500,400)}The fat one shoves in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:18.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur5\move(540,1030,540,995)\fad(500,400)}That's not loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:21.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur5\fs110\move(540,1030,540,995)\fad(500,400)}That's hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:24.00,Amber,,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur5\move(540,1030,540,995)\fad(500,400)}Main bhi aisa hoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:26.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur5\move(540,1030,540,995)\fad(500,400)}I rise for hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:28.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur5\fs110\move(540,1030,540,995)\fad(500,400)}Mostly yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:32.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur5\move(540,1030,540,995)\fad(500,400)}Call it love, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:35.00,Amber,,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur5\move(540,1030,540,995)\fad(500,400)}Kaun poochta hai fark?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:39.40,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur5\move(540,1030,540,995)\fad(500,400)}The old man doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.80,Amber,,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur5\move(540,1030,540,995)\fad(500,400)}You're allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:46.00,Amber,,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur5\move(540,1030,540,995)\fad(500,400)}to want this much.
